  "The other five T63 targets were not rerun. These finite checks retain their imported rank and expansion premises; they do not replace whole-proof acceptance. The two family domains overlap and are not added into aggregate coverage.": "其余五个 T63 核未重跑。这些有限核验保留所依赖的秩桥与展开前提，不替代整条证明验收；两个整族域有交叠，不合计为总覆盖率。",
