  "128 vertices · Run: v3": "128 个顶点 · 运行：v3",
  "v4 connected equality-chain recovery, legal exchanges and endpoint-compatible witnesses. Happy Ending and DD methods deepened; later main maintenance added global reassessment and ECC node reuse. v5 inherits these capabilities.": "v4 打通取等链回收、合法交换与端点相容见证，深化 Happy Ending 与 DD 方法；后续主线维护加入全局重评和 ECC 节点复用。v5 继承这些能力。",
  "Controlled choices & theorem reuse": "控制选择与定理复用",
  "Control auxiliary choices": "控制辅助选择",
  "Choose legal auxiliary objects so the actual successor meets the next proof step.": "合法选择辅助量，让实际后继满足下一步证明所需条件。",
  "Reuse theorems before more work": "先用新定理缩小余域",
  "Apply new results across known legal representations; work on what all gates leave open.": "先在已知合法表示中应用新定理，只向所有门均未覆盖的余域派工。",
  "Cover inputs with conditional plans": "用条件计划覆盖全域",
  "Use a fixed universal plan or a finite set whose applicable branch follows from the actual input.": "用一个全称计划，或依实际输入择一的有限计划集，覆盖全部合法输入。",
  "Separate the original input, legal auxiliary choices and the actual successor; construct the interface the next theorem needs.": "区分任意原输入、合法辅助选择与实际后继；构造下一定理需要的接口。",
  "Consume new theorems across known legal splits, transports and monotone completions before dispatching the residual domain.": "派工前先在已知合法切分、运输与单调补全中消费新定理，再研究真正余域。",
