  "Ruskey–Savage · Q₆ theorem → dense Q₇ matchings. Run: v3 (local adaptation); feedback for v5.": "Ruskey–Savage · Q₆ 定理 → Q₇ 稠密匹配。运行：v3（本地适配）；反馈 v5。",
  "v0: standalone tools. v1–v4: shared harness releases. v5: controlled choices and theorem reuse, informed by Q7 research run with v3.": "v0：独立研究工具。v1–v4：共享框架历史版本。v5：控制选择与定理复用，吸收采用 v3 推进的 Q7 研究。",
  "Q₇: ≥57-edge matchings extend; Run: v3 (local adaptation) → v5 feedback.": "Q₇：≥57 边匹配均可延拓；运行：v3（本地适配）→ 反馈 v5。",
