  "All matchings with at least 58 edges: complete dense layers and construction tools.": "至少 58 边的全部匹配：稠密层已闭合，并提供构造工具。",
  "All matchings with at least 57 edges: the 14-hole assembly and the denser layers form one complete theorem.": "至少 57 边的全部匹配：14 孔装配与更稠密层合成完整定理。",
  "At 56 edges: the μ=2 and μ=4 structure classes and several μ=3 families are complete.": "56 边时：μ=2、μ=4 结构层及若干 μ=3 整族已闭合。",
  "Here μ is the minimum absolute parity-hole difference across the seven coordinate splits. Structure classes are not equal fractions of progress.": "μ 是七个坐标切分中两色孔数差绝对值的最小值。结构层不是等份进度。",
  "Still open": "仍然开放",
  "The full Q₇ conjecture, P7 and seven-direction extension remain open. The complete 56-edge layer is not closed.": "完整 Q₇ 猜想、P7 与七方向延拓仍开放。56 边完整层尚未闭合。",
  "Why the method changed": "方法为何改变",
  "A compressed auxiliary pairing can fall outside the old P6 theorem's input domain. The new constructions control a legal donor pairing so the actual successor has the interface needed by the next proof step. Return bridges then restore the original prescribed edges.": "压缩得到的辅助配对可能超出旧 P6 定理的输入域。新构造控制合法供体配对，让实际后继具备下一步证明所需的接口，再通过返回桥恢复指定原边。",
  "Exact source-fiber and compatible-pool counts guide finite generation. New family theorems are used across known legal coordinate splits before more work is assigned. A fixed universal plan, or a finite plan set selected from the actual matching, covers every realization in its stated family.": "用精确来源纤维与兼容池计数指导有限生成；继续派工前，先在已知合法坐标切分中应用新的整族定理。固定全称计划或依实际匹配择一的有限计划集覆盖其所述整族的每个实现。",
  "What v5 learns": "v5 从中吸收什么",
  "Control auxiliary choices to make the next proof step possible.": "控制辅助选择，让下一步证明可行。",
  "Apply new theorems across known legal representations before assigning more work.": "继续派工前，先在已知合法表示中应用新定理。",
  "Cover every input with fixed or conditional finite plans.": "用固定或条件有限计划覆盖每个输入。",
  "The existing v4 global reassessment is inherited. Q7 methods deepen the same Hamilton plugin; they do not add a seventh domain or establish a measured workflow speedup.": "继承已有 v4 全局重评。Q7 方法深化同一个 Hamilton 插件，不增加第七个领域，也不代表已测得工作流提速。",
  "Q₆ remains available": "Q₆ 结论继续保留",
  "Every matching of Q₆ extends to a Hamilton cycle. With imported results, matchings using at most six directions in any dimension also extend. The Q₇ dense theorem does not establish seven-direction extension.": "Q₆ 的每个匹配均可延拓为 Hamilton 圈。结合文献进口，任意维中使用至多六个方向的匹配也能延拓。Q₇ 稠密定理并不建立七方向结论。",
  "Evidence and reading": "证据与阅读",
  "The intake replayed the saved S3 and S2_STRONG family-plan consumers. Their domains overlap; their counts are not combined into a coverage percentage. This did not rerun every underlying rank certificate or complete the full Q₇ conjecture.": "接收阶段重放了已有 S3 与 S2_STRONG 整族计划消费者。两族有交叠，不能将数量合计成覆盖率；这也没有重跑全部底层秩证书或闭合完整 Q₇ 猜想。",
