  "Back to results ↑": "返回成果 ↑",
  "Mathematical results by research thread. Persistent bubbles introduce each problem and show improvements with arrows. Property B shows pointwise bounds at v0 and incorporation of the uniform theorem at v1. ECC determines the exact optimal minimum distance for four code parameters, up from three. v4 incorporates a Happy Ending working proof lowering the ES(7) upper bound from 78 to 77. The new degree–diameter (10,4) result increases 2,566 to 2,567 vertices, produced with v2 and feeding v4. v5 incorporates the Q₇ ≥57-edge theorem and 56-edge structure families from a v3 local-adaptation run; full Q₇ remains open. Proof tools are recorded separately.": "按研究主题展示数学成果。常驻气泡展示新题与改进；v5 纳入采用 v3 本地适配研究的 Q₇ ≥57 边定理及 56 边结构整族，完整 Q₇ 仍开放。原 Q₆、Property B、ECC、Happy Ending 与 DD 结论及核验范围保留。",
  "Show MathRSI harness v5: Controlled choices & theorem reuse": "显示 MathRSI v5：控制选择与定理复用",
