  "-uniform hypergraph that is not 2-colorable. End-to-end Lean: m(5) ≥ 33, 34 and the uniform k ≥ 12 theorem. m(5) ≥ 35 is a complete written candidate proof; its Lean is incomplete. Other small k carry parameter-specific checks.": "-一致超图的最少边数。端到端 Lean 形式化已完成：m(5) ≥ 33, 34 以及 k ≥ 12 统一定理。m(5) ≥ 35 已有完整书面候选证明，其 Lean 形式化尚未完成。其余小 k 各有按参数核验的证据。",
  "1 example": "单个实例",
  "1,048,576 connectivity bits rebuilt; rank 1024 for 1024 forests.": "重建 1,048,576 个连通性比特；1024 棵森林满秩 1024。",
  "16 ≤ d₂(45,11) ≤ 17; distance 17 is still open.": "16 ≤ d₂(45,11) ≤ 17；距离 17 是否存在尚未解决。",
  "16,384 → 16,416 vertices under the same degree and diameter constraints; dated table comparison.": "相同度与直径约束下顶点数由 16,384 增至 16,416；基于采样日期的记录表对比。",
  "163 graph instances / 44 parameter pairs / 49 completed concrete-graph Lean instances. The ten new orders 2,558–2,567 add one parameter pair and two completed Lean instances; these are catalogue totals, not 163 records.": "目录总计：163 个图实例 / 44 组参数对 / 49 个已完成的具体图 Lean 实例。新增的 2,558–2,567 十个阶数贡献了 1 组参数对与 2 个已完成的 Lean 实例；以上为图库累计总数，而非 163 项纪录。",
  "2,566 → 2,567 vertices: a 10-regular graph of diameter 4, exceeding the Comellas entry checked 2026-11-05. Produced with MathRSI v2 + DD (including the PR #7 handoff repair). This result feeds v4; it was not produced by v4.": "2,566 → 2,567 个顶点：构造出直径为 4 的 10-正则图，超过 2026-11-05 核对的 Comellas 表条目。该结果由 MathRSI v2 + DD（含 PR #7 交接修补）实际运行产出，其研究经验反哺 v4，并非由 v4 跑出。",
