  ": the largest minimum distance of a binary linear code of length": "：二元线性码所能达到的最大最小距离，其中码长为",
  "; fewer points suffice to force a convex heptagon. Degree–Diameter:": "，更少的平面点即可保证出现凸七边形。度–直径问题：",
  "A 3 by 3 grid hypergraph colored with two colors so that no row or column is one color": "二染色的 3×3 网格超图，使每一行与每一列都不呈单一颜色",
  "A candidate reaches ≈0.59175 on the restricted working set; full-domain verification is still needed.": "候选解在受限工作集上达到 ≈0.59175；仍需全域核验。",
  "A checked 25-point abstract cup–cap witness; this is not a claim of a geometric realization or of optimal capacity from this check alone.": "经核验的 25 点抽象上下凸链（cup–cap）见证；单凭该项检验不构成几何可实现性或最优容量的声明。",
  "A cup, a cap and a convex heptagon": "下凸链、上凸链与凸七边形",
  "A finite forest-rank certificate covers the universal matching family.": "用有限的森林秩证书，证明结论覆盖所有匹配。",
  "A separate meta-evolve loop turns finished research into concrete workflow updates; Degree–Diameter enters as a domain plugin.": "独立的 meta-evolve 循环将已完成的研究转化为具体流程更新；度–直径问题作为领域插件接入。",
  "A stronger constructive lower bound: more vertices fit within the same degree and diameter.": "更强的构造性下界：在相同的度数与直径限制下容纳更多顶点。",
  "A tighter ceiling for square-free hypercube graphs": "无四圈超立方体子图密度的更紧上界",
