  "A tighter upper bound for convex heptagons": "凸七边形保证阈值：78 → 77",
  "A uniform analytic improvement over the combined RS baseline for every": "相比组合 RS 基线取得一致解析改进，覆盖所有",
  "A uniform analytic improvement over the specified RS baseline for every k ≥ 12, incorporated with the Property B methods into v1.": "对所有 k ≥ 12 相比指定 RS 基线取得一致解析改进，随 Property B 方法一并纳入 v1。",
  "Abstract witness": "抽象见证",
  "Adaptive stages": "自适应阶段",
  "Also ≤ 6 directions in any dimension, with imported results.": "结合已引入的结果，同样推广至任意维数中至多使用 6 个方向的匹配。",
  "An exact Gram certificate with full local coverage and analytic averaging gives the final bound.": "具备完整局部覆盖的精确 Gram 证书结合解析平均，给出最终上界。",
  "Any set of disjoint edges in the six-dimensional cube can be included in one cycle visiting all 64 vertices. This settles the six-dimensional case; the general conjecture remains open.": "六维超立方体中的任意一组互不相交边，都能包含在同一个遍历全部 64 个顶点的圈中。这解决了六维情形；一般维数的猜想仍未解决。",
  "Archived v3 working draft: N(7,6,7) ≤ 76, N(7,7,7) ≤ 77, hence ES(7) ≤ 78. The received follow-up is shown at v4.": "v3 归档工作稿给出 N(7,6,7) ≤ 76、N(7,7,7) ≤ 77，从而 ES(7) ≤ 78。后续收到的推进成果展示于 v4。",
  "Asymptotic C₄-free density": "无 C₄ 子图渐近边密度",
  "Asymptotic edge density of": "渐近边密度：",
  "Asymptotic edge density of C₄-free subgraphs of Qₙ; the conjectured 1/2 remains open.": "Qₙ 中无 C₄ 子图的渐近边密度；猜想值 1/2 仍未解决。",
  "Asymptotic edge density ≤ 0.59155154, improving the specified 0.60318 reference.": "渐近边密度 ≤ 0.59155154，改进了 0.60318 的基准上界。",
  "At a tight integer threshold, recover simultaneous zero-slack conditions on the same object.": "在紧整数阈值处，回收同一对象上同时成立的零松弛取等条件。",
  "At planned checkpoints—or when new local results leave the same bottleneck untouched—two independent agents reassess the whole problem. One checks what remains even if the current work succeeds; the other compares alternative routes and the total cost of finishing.": "在预设检查点，或当新的局部推进仍未触及核心瓶颈时，由两个独立智能体重新评估全局问题：一个检查即便当前工作完成仍剩余哪些原题义务，另一个比较替代路线与完成全题的总体成本。",
