  "Mathematical results": "数学成果",
  "Mathematical results by research thread. Persistent bubbles introduce each problem and show improvements with arrows. Property B shows pointwise bounds at v0 and incorporation of the uniform theorem at v1. ECC determines the exact optimal minimum distance for four code parameters, up from three. v4 incorporates a Happy Ending working proof lowering the ES(7) upper bound from 78 to 77. The new degree–diameter (10,4) result increases 2,566 to 2,567 vertices, produced with v2 and feeding v4. Proof tools are recorded separately.": "按研究主线排列的数学成果。常驻气泡展示各课题首次引入的成果，并用箭头标示后续改进：Property B 在 v0 展示逐点下界、在 v1 纳入统一定理；ECC 将确定精确最优最小距离的参数从 3 组扩至 4 组；v4 纳入 Happy Ending 工作证明，将 ES(7) 上界由 78 降至 77；度–直径问题新增 (10,4) 成果将顶点数由 2,566 提至 2,567（由 v2 跑出并反哺 v4）。证明工具与核验记录单独列出。",
