  "N measures the maximum size avoiding specified paths and weak heptagons; ES is the geometric forcing threshold. The 75/76 structural manuscripts are received and await independent mathematical review; they have no completed Lean verification. They use the restricted capacity 25 with its historical SAT acceptance. The independently checked 25-point abstract witness supports a separate lower-bound claim. Bounds of 74 apply only to specified subclasses.": "N 度量避免指定凹凸路径与弱七边形的最大点集规模，ES 则为几何迫出阈值。75/76 结构证明原稿已收到，正待独立数学审阅，尚无已完成的 Lean 核验；证明使用了带历史 SAT 验收的受限容量 25。经独立核验的 25 点抽象见证支撑另一项独立的下界结论。74 的上界仅适用于特定子类。",
