  "The broader portfolio contains 153 graphs over 43 parameter pairs; 47 have concrete-graph Lean proofs.": "更广泛的构造目录包含 43 组参数对上的 153 个图实例，其中 47 个具有具体图的 Lean 证明。",
  "The coordinator then changes the next task: connect a missing proof step, change the representation, switch routes, assemble a sufficient result, or continue within a concrete budget. Necessary complete calculations retain their completion plan.": "随后协调器据此调整下一步动作：补齐缺失的证明衔接、更换数学表征、切换求解路线、装配已足够的结论，或在明确预算内继续推进；确有必要的完整计算则保留其完成计划。",
  "The first three follow from the original exclusion; 42/16 applies a published 2020 theorem. Lean reductions keep explicit literature, classification and computation premises. d₂(45,11) remains 16–17.": "前三组结果来自原有排除证明；42/16 应用了已发表的 2020 年定理。Lean 归约显式保留了文献、分类与计算前提。d₂(45,11) 仍为 16–17。",
  "The full-domain maximum is ≈0.83472, far above the working-set claim. Previous certificate retained.": "全域最大值达 ≈0.83472，远高于工作集上的目标值；保留此前已核验的证书。",
  "The violated rows go back to the route; later refinements consume them.": "违反约束的行作为反例回传至路线阶段，供后续迭代直接使用。",
  "The working manuscript lowers our previous upper bound from 78 to 77: every 77-point planar set in general position would contain seven points in convex position.": "该工作证明原稿将此前的上界从 78 推进至 77：平面上一般位置的任意 77 个点中，必有 7 个点构成凸七边形。",
