  "Test candidate splits on the hardest open branch before adoption; measure net-new union coverage on the same actual input.": "采纳新分类前先在最难的未闭合分支上做小规模试探，并在同一输入上统计真正新增的覆盖范围。",
  "Primal–dual coevolution": "上下界协同搜索",
  "Separate proof goal from search target, rotate signed residuals, and refute candidate cuts against the full archive.": "将证明目标与对抗搜索目标分开，轮换带符号归一化残差，并在全部历史构造上检验候选不等式。",
  "Stop at repair-residual floor": "修补误差阈值停机",
  "Halt float SDP/CP loops when gains fall below repair residuals; never treat an approximate fit as a proved barrier.": "当浮点 SDP/CP 单轮增益低于修补残差时停止迭代，不把未认证近似拟合当作已证屏障。",
  "Gate new classifications by bounded probes on the hardest residual branch; easy sibling passes do not reset stall counters.": "以最难残余分支的有界探针把关新分类准入；简单旁支通过不重置停滞计数。",
  "Run primal–dual coevolution with goal/target separation, 4-channel normalized signed residuals and full-archive refutation.": "运行分离证明目标与对抗搜索目标、轮换四路带符号归一化残差并在全图库上检验候选不等式的上下界协同循环。",
  "Stop outer float SDP/CP iterations when apparent improvement falls below repair residuals; record nonzero residuals beside any approximate fit.": "当表观改进低于修补残差时停止外层浮点 SDP/CP 迭代；在任何近似拟合旁并列记录非零可行性残差。",
  "C₄-free & Q7 E16: v3 + coevolve → v6 methods.": "无四圈超立方体与 Q7 E16：v3 + 协同搜索 → v6 方法。",
  "v6 release. Incorporates C₄-free Q₇ (304 construction verified; 304 upper bound source-reported), Q₈ (682–683), asymptotic density Q∞ ≤ 0.5912405943, and complete Q₇ E16 (≥56 edges). Distills hardest-remainder split gating, primal–dual coevolution and repair-residual stopping into the shared base.": "v6 正式版。纳入无 C₄ 超立方体 Q₇（304 边构造已验证；304 上界按原包报告，本次未复验）、Q₈（682–683）、渐近密度 Q∞ ≤ 0.5912405943 及完整 Q₇ E16（≥56 边），并将最难分支试探、上下界协同搜索与修补误差停机提炼进共享通用流程。",
  "v0: standalone tools. v1–v5: shared harness releases. v6: hardest-remainder gates and primal–dual coevolution, informed by Q7 E16 and C₄-free Q₇ / Q₈ / Q∞ runs.": "v0：独立研究工具。v1–v5：共享框架历史版本。v6：最难分支试探与上下界协同搜索，提炼自 Q7 E16 与无 C₄ 的 Q₇ / Q₈ / Q∞ 研究。",
  "Mathematical results by research thread across v0 to v6. Persistent bubbles introduce each problem and show improvements. Property B shows pointwise bounds at v0 and the uniform k ≥ 12 theorem at v1. ECC determines four exact optimal minimum distances. v4 incorporates Happy Ending working proofs (ES(7) ≤ 77) and the DD (10,4) 2,567-vertex graph. v5 incorporates Q₇ ≥57-edge matchings and DD D5 endpoints (11,5) 37,632 and (12,5) 42,433. v6 incorporates C₄-free Q₇ (304 construction verified; 304 upper bound source-reported), Q₈ (682–683), asymptotic density Q∞ ≤ 0.5912405943, and complete Q₇ E16 (≥56 edges). Proof tools and run provenance are recorded separately.": "按研究主题展示 v0 至 v6 的数学成果与框架演进。v6 纳入无 C₄ 超立方体 Q₇（304 边构造已验证；304 上界按原包报告，本次未复验）、Q₈（682–683）、渐近密度 Q∞ ≤ 0.5912405943 与完整 Q₇ E16（≥56 边）；其余各题历史成果、证明工具与运行归属分别保留。",
  "Erdős 86: Q₇ 304 (construction verified; ≤304 source-reported) · Q₈ 682–683 · Q∞ ≤ 0.5912405943.": "Erdős 86：Q₇ 304（304 边构造已验证；304 上界按原包报告，本次未复验）· Q₈ 682–683 · Q∞ ≤ 0.5912405943。",
  "Q₇: ≥56-edge matchings extend (complete E16); Run: v3 → v5/v6 feedback.": "Q₇：≥56 边匹配均可延拓（完整 E16）；运行：v3 → 反馈 v5/v6。",
