  "Q₈ · 682 ≤ ex(Q₈, C₄) ≤ 683": "Q₈ · 682 ≤ ex(Q₈, C₄) ≤ 683",
  "Four 682-edge C₄-free constructions plus Theorem B ruling out 684 edges via 83 active inequalities and 25 Q₆ imports (same-family/provisional audit). Primary goal ex(Q₈, C₄) ≤ 682 remains open.": "四份 682 边无 C₄ 构造结合定理 B（83 条活跃不等式与 25 份 Q₆ 导入，同家族暂定终审）排除 684 边。主目标 ex(Q₈, C₄) ≤ 682 仍开放。",
