  "Unconditional T3 ≤ 0.5912405943 (COP + cubic) and T4 ≤ 0.5912405942 (m = 1024 degree potential via a 5-line hypergeometric tower). 0.5907 and retracted 0.5899 are non-theorems; limit 1/2 remains open.": "无条件定理 T3 ≤ 0.5912405943（COP + 三次型）与 T4 ≤ 0.5912405942（m = 1024 度数势配五行超几何塔）。0.5907 与已撤回的 0.5899 均非定理；极限猜想 1/2 仍开放。",
  "Q₇ complete E16 · ≥56 edges": "Q₇ 完整 E16 · ≥56 条边",
  "Every Q₇ matching with at least 56 edges (at most 16 holes, all μ ∈ {0,1,2,3,4}) extends to a Hamilton cycle retaining every prescribed edge. Layers ≤55 edges, full Q₇, P₇ and seven-direction lifting remain open.": "Q₇ 中至少 56 边（至多 16 孔，涵盖全部 μ ∈ {0,1,2,3,4}）的每个匹配均可延拓为保留全部原边的 Hamilton 圈。≤55 边各层、完整 Q₇、P₇ 与七方向提升仍开放。",
  "C++17/20 replays & coevolution engine": "C++17/20 全域重放与协同引擎",
