  "Q₇: two explicit 304-edge C₄-free constructions verified; 304 upper bound as reported in the source package, not re-verified in this pass (21 raw .cnf/.drup traces omitted upstream). Q₈: four 682-edge seeds and C++17 13,150,453-completion replay verified; Theorem B whole-proof audit is same-family/provisional and imports 25 Q₆ DRAT certificates; ex(Q₈, C₄) ≤ 682 remains open. Q∞: T3 = 681653995482306581 / 1152921504606846976 ≤ 0.5912405943 and T4 = 9701859764505653085708308080340303 / 16409326186106551516455239680000000 ≤ 0.5912405942 (via a 5-line hypergeometric tower for all n ≥ 1024), both rechecked in 128-bit C++20; 0.5907 and retracted 0.5899 are non-theorems.": "Q₇：两份显式 304 边无 C₄ 构造已验证；304 上界按原包报告，本次未复验（21 份原始 .cnf/.drup 轨迹在原汇编中未随包）。Q₈：四份 682 边构造与 C++17 全部 13,150,453 个补全重放已验证；定理 B 整证审查为同家族暂定并导入 25 份 Q₆ DRAT 证书；ex(Q₈, C₄) ≤ 682 仍开放。Q∞：T3 = 681653995482306581 / 1152921504606846976 ≤ 0.5912405943 与 T4 = 9701859764505653085708308080340303 / 16409326186106551516455239680000000 ≤ 0.5912405942（经对一切 n ≥ 1024 成立的五行超几何塔），均经 C++20 128 位重算复验；0.5907 与已撤回的 0.5899 均非定理。",
  "Q₇ · every matching with ≥56 edges": "Q₇ · 至少 56 边的每个匹配",
  "Complete E16 closure across all 16-hole classes μ ∈ {0,1,2,3,4}: a Hamilton cycle on all 128 vertices retains every prescribed edge. Layers ≤55 edges and full Q₇ remain open.": "完整闭合全部 16 孔层 μ ∈ {0,1,2,3,4}（E16）：经过全部 128 个顶点的 Hamilton 圈保留每条指定原边。≤55 边各层与完整 Q₇ 仍开放。",
  "Run: v3 (local adaptation) → methods feed v5 & v6.": "运行：v3（本地适配）→ 方法反馈 v5 与 v6。",
  "Erdős Problem 86 results by setting: Q7 construction 304 verified (304 upper bound source-reported), Q8 narrowed to 682–683, and asymptotic C4-free density lowered from 0.60318 to at most 0.5912405943 (T3) and 0.5912405942 (T4).": "Erdős 86 分参数成果：Q₇ 的 304 边构造已验证（304 上界按原包报告，本次未复验），Q₈ 收窄至 682–683，无 C₄ 渐近密度上界由 0.60318 降至 ≤ 0.5912405943（T3）与 ≤ 0.5912405942（T4）。",
  "Results · Q₇ 304 (≤ source), Q₈ 682–683 and asymptotic Q∞ ≤ 0.5912405943": "成果 · Q₇ 304（上界按原包报告）、Q₈ 682–683 与渐近 Q∞ ≤ 0.5912405943",
