  "Ruskey–Savage Q6 and Q7 theorem diagram: every matching in Q6 extends to a Hamilton cycle (and <=6 directions in Qn); in Q7, every matching with at least 56 edges (complete E16) extends to a Hamilton cycle.": "Ruskey–Savage Q₆ 与 Q₇ 定理图示：Q₆ 的每个匹配均可延拓为 Hamilton 圈（含 Qₙ 至多 6 方向推论）；Q₇ 中至少 56 边的每个匹配（完整 E16）均可延拓为 Hamilton 圈。",
  "Results · universal Q₆ theorem, ≤6 directions in Qₙ, and Q₇ ≥56-edge matchings (E16)": "成果 · Q₆ 全称定理、Qₙ ≤6 方向推论及 Q₇ ≥56 边匹配延拓（E16）",
